Bug bounty tips

Recon has 2 main parts
- Asset discovery : domain, subdomain, IP addresses, 
- Content discovery : bruteforcing files or directories, scraping Javascript files or crawling using tools like Katana

1 Asset discovery
subdomain:
edit subfinder config file : nano ~/.config/subfinder/config.yaml
add API key in provider file : nano ~/.config/subfinder/provider-config.yaml

suffledns : Allow to bruteforce different domains
Download resolvers.txt : https://raw.githubusercontent.com/trickest/resolvers/refs/heads/main/resolvers.txt
Using a wordlist from SecList or SecNotes, we can bruteforce and get result in output file domains.txt :
shuffledns -d example.com -w wordlists.txt -r resolvers.txt -mode bruteforce -o domains.txt -silent

* Subdomains permutation
cat domains.txt | alterx | tee -a subdomains-dnsx.txt
( alterx config can be modified : nano  ~/.config/alterx/permutation_v0.0.6.yaml )
-enrich option is worth looking


* Resolving DNS records
#To find which domains resolve from previous list:
cat subdomains-dnsx.txt | dnsx

# We could use all in one-line :
subfinder -all -d domain.com | alterx | dnsx
or cat subdomains.txt | alterx | dnsx


* Port scanning with Naabu (requires libpcap : sudo apt install -y libpcap-dev
cat subdomains.txt | alterx | dnsx | naabu -top-ports 100 -ep 22 -o open-ports.txt

* Information gathering
cat subdomains.txt | alterx | dnsx | naabu -top-ports 100 -ep 22 -o open-ports.txt | httpx
or
cat open-ports.txt | httpx -tittle -sc -cl -location -fr -o httpx.txt

* Web crawling with Katana
katana -u sub.domain.com -jc
katana -u sub.domain.com -jsl -d 5

cat open-ports.txt | katana -jsl

* Authenticated crawling
katana -u sub.domain.com -jsl -H "Cookie : XXXSESSID=XXXX"

